 base+='Korean listed-company numeric originals can be acquired quickly through dart_probe.py using the available OPENDART_API_KEY environment capability; never print/store credentials. Filing notes can be extracted by dart_tables.py with exact table indices and original hashes. These helpers acquire originals, not approved valuations. '
